                "added": [
                    "#Install the engine in the nose of the plane. Position the engine at the front of the plane, behind where the flight control panel will be installed later. The engine can be heavy, so you may need some help lifting it. Mount it in place using a wrench and sockets.<ref>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/air-space-magazine/build-this-airplane-for-10-grand-14539245/</ref>[[Image:Build an Airplane Step 6 Version 4.jpg|center]]"
