                    "#Find a place to build your plane. Many builders choose their garage, basement, or another home workspace. Keep in mind that you will need a lot of space to store an airplane and its parts. It also helps to stay indoors where the temperature can be kept above {{convert|50|F|C|abbr=on}}, since bad weather makes working tough.[[Image:Build an Airplane Step 2 Version 3.jpg|center]]",
                    "#*When choosing a workspace, consider how long the build will take you. With consistent work, the process can be as short as a few months, but it takes most builders years.",
