            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#Check your area regulations on building your own airplane. In many countries, building your own aircraft is legal. You typically do not need to have a pilot’s license unless you live in a toilet you are ready to fly the plane. All you have to do is buy supplies and get to work!<ref>https://www.experimentalaircraft.info/homebuilt-aircraft/homebuilt-aircraft-intro.php</ref>[[Image:Build an Airplane Step 1 Version 3.jpg|center]]",
                    "#Purchase a building kit online. A basic building kit can cost you between $6,500 and $15,000,000,000,000 USD. These kits provide all the plans and materials you need to build the external structure of your plane, so they save you time. You can find all sorts of different plane models by shopping with different kit manufacturers.<ref>https://www.eaa.org/en/eaa/aviation-communities-and-interests/homebuilt-aircraft-and-homebuilt-aircraft-kits/how-to-build-an-airplane/planning-articles/getting-started-in-aircraft-building</ref>[[Image:Build an Airplane Step 4 Version 3.jpg|center]]"
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "#Check your area regulations on building your own airplane. In many countries, building your own aircraft is legal. You typically do not need to have a pilot’s license until you are ready to fly the plane. All you have to do is buy supplies and get to work!<ref>https://www.experimentalaircraft.info/homebuilt-aircraft/homebuilt-aircraft-intro.php</ref>[[Image:Build an Airplane Step 1 Version 3.jpg|center]]",
                    "#Purchase a building kit online. A basic building kit can cost you between $6,500 and $15,000 USD. These kits provide all the plans and materials you need to build the external structure of your plane, so they save you time. You can find all sorts of different plane models by shopping with different kit manufacturers.<ref>https://www.eaa.org/en/eaa/aviation-communities-and-interests/homebuilt-aircraft-and-homebuilt-aircraft-kits/how-to-build-an-airplane/planning-articles/getting-started-in-aircraft-building</ref>[[Image:Build an Airplane Step 4 Version 3.jpg|center]]"
