                "removed": [
                    "#First Construct a Boeing 747, place your plane on a 2 mile runway, then accelerate to about 6345 km/h, once this step is complete, pull the level back to lift your planes nose lift upwards. When complete you should now be flying, if you have constructed the plane correctly then start flying towards a building with above 5000 people inside, preferably one with high importance. When done if accurate enough, there should be a CRISIS happening, thousands of people should now be dead, including you, causing a mass homicide collection. Hope this helped."
